</figure>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS4.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">4.4.2 </span>Performance on Reasoning Benchmarks</h4>

<div id="S4.SS4.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS4.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We conduct a comprehensive evaluation of various methods on the LLaMA3.1-8B model using two additional benchmark datasets, GSM8K and HumanEval. As demonstrated in the Table <a href="#S4.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 4.4.2 Performance on Reasoning Benchmarks ‣ 4.4 Analysis of Method Generalizability ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ HyperAdaLoRA: Accelerating LoRA Rank Allocation During Training via Hypernetworks without Sacrificing Performance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, our approach does not result in any performance degradation on these complex tasks.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<div id="S4.T3.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:327.8pt;height:31.4pt;vertical-align:-14.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-95.2pt,9.1pt) scale(0.632549296152925,0.632549296152925) ;">
